<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Jan trade surplus 10.8 bln SKR.</title>
<headline>Swedish Jan trade surplus 10.8 bln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's January trade surplus was 10.8 billion crowns ($1.5 billion), Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p> Exports			 +47.7	+44.7	+46.2</p>
<p> Imports			 +36.9	+36.4	+35.0</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +10.8	 +8.3	+11.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a surplus of 11.3 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
